"""omarchy-keybind-trainer - drill your Hyprland keybindings for real.

Reads the live binding set from `hyprctl binds`, serves a browser game on
loopback, and temporarily unbinds whichever binding is being tested so the
keystroke falls through to the browser instead of firing the action.

See ~/Projects/Omarchy_config/keybinding-trainer/README.md.
"""

